      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5978046::chunk::000::abstract::93e23f7e34"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical alloying followed by SPS will produce and retain a grain size below 50 nm.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::chunk::000::abstract::f895614108",
        "PMC5978046::chunk::000::abstract::93e23f7e34"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS below 1000°C will retain the nanocrystalline grain structure.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed processing route will avoid brittle intermetallic formation.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10154406::chunk::002::results::85fd43f3b9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Processing under argon will minimize oxygen contamination.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical alloying induces severe plastic deformation, high dislocation density, and grain refinement.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5978046::chunk::000::abstract::93e23f7e34",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::001::introduction::73adf78dd5"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Low VEC together with ΔH_mix, atomic-size mismatch, and Ω stabilizes a dual-BCC phase constitution.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid SPS consolidation locks in the mechanically alloyed nanocrystalline grain size.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine-grained BCC matrices receive a strengthening contribution from grain boundaries.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5978046::chunk::000::abstract::93e23f7e34"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A nanocrystalline grain size increases yield strength through the Hall-Petch effect.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5978046::chunk::000::abstract::93e23f7e34",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::001::introduction::73adf78dd5"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The dual-BCC solid-solution structure provides solid-solution strengthening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5978046::chunk::000::abstract::93e23f7e34"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The processed W-Ta-Cr-V-Hf alloy will have a yield strength above 2500 MPa.",
